SUMMARY:Intermediate Crochet with Mary Schwitzer - Make a Hat\, Day 1
DESCRIPTION:Do you know the foundational crochet stitches but want to learn more? Come learn some new stitches and techniques to use for even more fun\, then use what you learn to make a hat to keep! \nThis workshop will take place over three Saturdays; August 1st\, August 8th\, and August 15th\, 12:30-4:00 PM. \nClass is limited to four participants. \nREGISTRATION CLOSED \n\n           Download QR
