SUMMARY:Beginning Sock Knitting with Yvonne Jones\, Week 3
DESCRIPTION:You’ve learned to knit so now what?  Well\, let’s knit some socks!  This workshop will be for the very beginner sock knitter\, but suitable if you are a cuff-down sock knitter and would like to try toe-up.  We will talk about different types of sock\, heel\, and toe construction\, then we will CAST-ON for a Beginner TOE-UP MAGIC LOOP Sock! \nThe workshop will take place over 4 weeks; Saturdays\, August 22\, August 29\, September 5\, & September 12\, 2026. 1:00- 4:00 PM each day. \nWeek 3: We will have a “rest” week so you catch up or begin knitting the leg of your sock.  We may meet to just knit together and do a Q&A time. \nSee Beginning Sock Knitting with Yvonne Jones\, Week 1 to register. \n\n           Download QR
